    "title": "Keurig",
    "description": "<p><span>Connect to all the delicious possibilities of Keurig\u00ae \u2014 anytime, anywhere. Our easy-to-use app lets you shop hundreds of varieties, discover innovative brewers for every\u202flifestyle, and manage your account with the swipe of a finger. Tap INSTALL to:</span><span>\u200b</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Explore over 40 top-rated brands, including Green Mountain Coffee Roasters \u00ae, The Original Donut Shop\u00ae, Dunkin\u2019\u00ae, Starbucks\u00ae, Peets\u00ae, and McCaf\u00e9\u00ae in K-Cup\u00ae pods,\u202fbagged coffee, and canned coffee. With so many options to choose from, you\u2019re sure to find a variety, roast, or flavor that makes you happy.\u202f</span><span>\u200b</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Save 25% on every order with our commitment-free Auto-Delivery.* With Auto-Delivery, you can add, delete, or change items, or pause a delivery in seconds.\u202f</span><span>\u200b</span></p>\r\n<p><span>See the latest in brewer technology, including the new Keurig\u00ae K-Supreme Plus\u00ae SMART with groundbreaking features like:</span><span>\u200b</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>BrewID\u2122\u202f</span></strong><span>Recognizes your K-Cup\u00ae pod and customizes the brew settings to make each cup distinctively delicious\u202f</span></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Ultimate Customization</span></strong><span>\u202fFine-tune your cup to be even more to your liking, choosing from 5 strengths, 6 temperatures, and 5 cup settings.</span><span>\u200b</span></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Connected Convenience</span></strong><span>\u202fBrew anytime, anywhere with your preferred settings.</span></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Multistream\u202fTechnology \u2122</span></strong><span>\u202fExtracts more flavor and aroma** in every cup.</span><span>\u200b</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>*Restrictions apply. See\u202f</span><a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.keurig.com%2Fauto-delivery&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw3tHB15jK45SfF5_33EvEJV\"><span>www.Keurig.com/auto-delivery</span></a><span>\u202f</span><span>for details.</span><span>\u200b</span><span>\u00a0</span></p>\r\n<p><span>**Vs. leading national Keurig\u00ae K-Classic\u00ae brewer\u202f</span></p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p><span>Connect to all the delicious possibilities of Keurig\u00ae \u2014 anytime, anywhere. Our easy-to-use app lets you shop hundreds of varieties, discover innovative brewers for every\u202flifestyle, and manage your account with the swipe of a finger. Tap INSTALL to:</span><span>\u200b</span></p><br><p><span>Explore over 40 top-rated brands, including Green Mountain Coffee Roasters \u00ae, The Original Donut Shop\u00ae, Dunkin\u2019\u00ae, Starbucks\u00ae, Peets\u00ae, and McCaf\u00e9\u00ae in K-Cup\u00ae pods,\u202fbagged coffee, and canned coffee. With so many options to choose from, you\u2019re sure to find a variety, roast, or flavor that makes you happy.\u202f</span><span>\u200b</span></p><br><p><span>Save 25% on every order with our commitment-free Auto-Delivery.* With Auto-Delivery, you can add, delete, or change items, or pause a delivery in seconds.\u202f</span><span>\u200b</span></p><br><p><span>See the latest in brewer technology, including the new Keurig\u00ae K-Supreme Plus\u00ae SMART with groundbreaking features like:</span><span>\u200b</span></p><br><ul><br><li><strong><span>BrewID\u2122\u202f</span></strong><span>Recognizes your K-Cup\u00ae pod and customizes the brew settings to make each cup distinctively delicious\u202f</span></li><br><li><strong><span>Ultimate Customization</span></strong><span>\u202fFine-tune your cup to be even more to your liking, choosing from 5 strengths, 6 temperatures, and 5 cup settings.</span><span>\u200b</span></li><br><li><strong><span>Connected Convenience</span></strong><span>\u202fBrew anytime, anywhere with your preferred settings.</span></li><br><li><strong><span>Multistream\u202fTechnology \u2122</span></strong><span>\u202fExtracts more flavor and aroma** in every cup.</span><span>\u200b</span></li><br></ul><br><p><span>*Restrictions apply. See\u202f</span><a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.keurig.com%2Fauto-delivery&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tHB15jK45SfF5_33EvEJV\"><span>www.Keurig.com/auto-delivery</span></a><span>\u202f</span><span>for details.</span><span>\u200b</span><span>\u00a0</span></p><br><p><span>**Vs. leading national Keurig\u00ae K-Classic\u00ae brewer\u202f</span></p>",
